{"requirements": [{"id": "closing-slack-post", "context": "requests that end with a closing post in a Slack channel", "expected_behavior": "after the main update, post the requested message in the named channel before finishing", "observed_behavior": "the agent made the update and finished without the post, saying its instructions do not cover closing steps of this kind", "acceptance": "the requested message is in the named channel when the task ends", "recurrence": 1}], "next_action": "none", "reason": "one note, one general mechanism: a standing working note for closing channel posts", "proposals": [{"hypothesis": "The agent skips closing Slack posts because no instruction covers them; a working note that says to make the post fixes this class of request.", "requirements": ["closing-slack-post"], "changes": [{"target": "worker.harness", "kind": "workflow", "change": {"patch": {"write": {"manifest.json": "{
 "api_version": "harness_package.v1",
